<title>FRANCE: Fr Telecom envoy to meet D. Telekom head.</title>
<headline>Fr Telecom envoy to meet D. Telekom head.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Michel Delebarre, an envoy appointed by the French government to consider the future of France Telecom, will meet the head of Deutsche Telekom around mid-August, a France Telecom source said.</p>
<p>The source quoted Delebarre as having told staff that opening up the capital of the company was one, but not the only, issue which would be considered in his review, due to be completed and presented by around September 5.</p>
</text>
